UR GPIO KEYS + INDEPENDENT POWER" (at 15.24 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left)) (uuid "890a7bf0-4474-57d7-b987-7dbfd90766f7"))(text "04  SINGLE-WIRE SDI PROGRAMMING" (at 15.24 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left)) (uuid "6107f367-28e2-5cf6-a5c6-4df0d2a1a209"))(text "05  MECHANICAL MOUNTS" (at 142.24 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left)) (uuid "1063959c-33bf-59b1-bfc3-b4490a5fa8ce"))(text "3.3 V ONLY. J1 pinout and position unchanged.\nI2C target address 0x1C, CUSTOM register protocol.\nINT_N = PC0 open-drain output, active low.\nPD7/RST requires reset option-byte configuration." (at 289.56 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "73a7f42b-6c8b-5c0d-b2ee-74aff627c9bb"))(text "SW1 POWER is electrically independent of U1.\nR14 pull-up remains on +3V3; press shorts to GND.\nFour ordinary keys report through MCU I2C." (at 15.24 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "02098590-0a8a-5a90-8068-05dd609ee98b"))(text "J2 has bare pads only: VREF, SWIO, GND, RESET.\nKeep PD1 single-wire debug enabled.\nDo not fit the old AT42QT2120 or TCA6408A." (at 15.24 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "c80e8706-3284-559f-b929-18c00794df19"))(text "PROTOTYPE: firmware and final-cover calibration required.\nMCU touch SDK includes wheel interpolation; validate circular wrap,\nnoise while charging and standby current before production." (at 157.48 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9f94e4b2-ba42-5383-885d-681e9727b5b3")))
